    {
      "id": "XpulC0rDb4iuZx88CTiJs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1742.618380002353,
      "y": 866.2854732600243,
      "width": 308,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 109401285,
      "version": 946,
      "versionNonce": 560144549,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783863836663,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Traffic calculations\n- 10M DAU\n- Avg upload/user/day = 2\n- Avg download/user/day = 10\n\nUploads: 10M * 2 = 20M\nDownloads: 10M * 10 = 100M\n\nAvg upload RPS\n20 * 10^6 / 10^5 = 200 RPS\n\nAvg download RPS\n100 * 10^6 / 10^5 ~ 1000 RPS\n\nTraffic spikes\n5 * values\nupload = 1000\ndownload = 5000\n\nHigh read volume",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Traffic calculations\n- 10M DAU\n- Avg upload/user/day = 2\n- Avg download/user/day = 10\n\nUploads: 10M * 2 = 20M\nDownloads: 10M * 10 = 100M\n\nAvg upload RPS\n20 * 10^6 / 10^5 = 200 RPS\n\nAvg download RPS\n100 * 10^6 / 10^5 ~ 1000 RPS\n\nTraffic spikes\n5 * values\nupload = 1000\ndownload = 5000\n\nHigh read volume",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-lKcMR3waCCBNe381BNL8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2130.2503660125403,
      "y": 846.5106435938366,
      "width": 616,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2124537893,
      "version": 1441,
      "versionNonce": 1162272971,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783865389153,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Calculations Continuation\n\n250 rps goes to DB with cache involved\n\nAvg file size = 10 MB\n\n5GB hot file --> fetched\nCDN --> cache file from S3\n\nEach chunk uploads takes 400ms for upload\nfile size: 10GB = 10 * 10^9\nchunk size 5MB = 5 * 10^6\ntotal chunks 10^10 / 5 * 10^6 = 0.2 * 10^4 = 2000 chunks\ntotal time = 2000 * 400ms = 800 s ~ 13 mins\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Calculations Continuation\n\n250 rps goes to DB with cache involved\n\nAvg file size = 10 MB\n\n5GB hot file --> fetched\nCDN --> cache file from S3\n\nEach chunk uploads takes 400ms for upload\nfile size: 10GB = 10 * 10^9\nchunk size 5MB = 5 * 10^6\ntotal chunks 10^10 / 5 * 10^6 = 0.2 * 10^4 = 2000 chunks\ntotal time = 2000 * 400ms = 800 s ~ 13 mins\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IVMNIZsUJQcVVQerdOsaG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 599.6607142857142,
      "y": 294.43300603671696,
      "width": 506,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 879884685,
      "version": 1062,
      "versionNonce": 2145043115,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783860861546,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REST API Endpoints\n\n- Request: POST /v1/files\n  BODY: Files metad data\n  Response: pre-signed url\n \n- Request: PUT {presigned-url}\n  Body: Raw File\n\n- Request: GET /v1/files/:fileId\n  Response: file\n\n- Request: PATCH /v1/files/:fileId/share\n  Body: userId []\n  200 success\n\n- Request: GET v1/files/sync?since={timeStamp}\n  Response: changes []",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "REST API Endpoints\n\n- Request: POST /v1/files\n  BODY: Files metad data\n  Response: pre-signed url\n \n- Request: PUT {presigned-url}\n  Body: Raw File\n\n- Request: GET /v1/files/:fileId\n  Response: file\n\n- Request: PATCH /v1/files/:fileId/share\n  Body: userId []\n  200 success\n\n- Request: GET v1/files/sync?since={timeStamp}\n  Response: changes []",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LzYQGAGCzSLARwRWqXYGy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600.9523560708594,
      "y": -31.716077183828133,
      "width": 682,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0V",
