      "seed": 1668077965,
      "version": 1216,
      "versionNonce": 334459659,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783865634420,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- User should be able to upload the files (imgs, videos, etc)\n- User should be able to download files\n- User should be able to share the files\n- Sync files across devices\n\nNon-functional Requirements\n- Availability > Cosistency\n- Low latency in download and Upload\n- Be able to handle large files (<= 50GB)\n- Continue upload feature\n- Files should be accessable only to people to whom its shared",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- User should be able to upload the files (imgs, videos, etc)\n- User should be able to download files\n- User should be able to share the files\n- Sync files across devices\n\nNon-functional Requirements\n- Availability > Cosistency\n- Low latency in download and Upload\n- Be able to handle large files (<= 50GB)\n- Continue upload feature\n- Files should be accessable only to people to whom its shared",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
